WEBVTT

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.110
Happy with your treatment?

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.870
Leave a few words in a review.

00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:06.383
Your review helps the salon do even better,

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:08.910
and helps other customers choose the right place.

00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:10.350
It only takes half a minute.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:15.633
After each appointment, VaraaAi sends you an email inviting you to leave a review.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.553
Just tap the button in that email.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:22.033
Or open My bookings yourself, find your booking, and tap Leave a review.

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:24.115
A small window opens.

00:00:24.217 --> 00:00:28.275
Under Service quality, tap the number of stars, from one to five.

00:00:28.702 --> 00:00:31.475
Below, write a few lines about your experience.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.315
Then tap Submit review.

00:00:33.923 --> 00:00:35.886
The screen says Thanks for your review.

00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:38.766
The salon reads it, and publishes it on their page.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:44.126
Only customers who booked can write a review, so every review on VaraaAi is real.

00:00:44.156 --> 00:00:45.646
Now take the quiz below!
